# Dependencies
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Environment files (built at runtime in container)
**/.env
**/*.env
**/production.env
**/development.env

# Docker files (not needed inside container)
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# Build outputs (rebuilt in container)
**/dist
**/build

# Development files
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Documentation (not needed in container)
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# Test files
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.js
**/tests
**/coverage

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Misc
.editorconfig
.eslintcache
*.swp
*.swo
Thumbs.db
